Package: 3d-print-uploader
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: 3D Printing William
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libxext6, libxft2, libxrender1
Description: Upload 3D printing files to Google Drive
 Creates stable public download links and QR codes, with optional Beacons.ai
 integration. Each user supplies their own Google OAuth credentials.
